        },
        {
          "text": "Joshua yavoola, “Kigira ki oleeti kivi yiki choosi ku kunyi? Yahova alaleeta ikivi ku ivi mwene kalunu!” Avandu vosi vamulasa na magina nakuza kandi valasa vandu vinyumba yeeye na magina kandi nivavasamba harara ni miandu jije josi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.7.25"
            ]
